---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../config";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" canonicalPath="/en/" title="Riot account verification" description="Moon Poro links Discord and League of Legends accounts through Riot Sign On, then synchronises region and Solo/Duo rank roles.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Moon Poro · Riot Sign On verification</p>
      <h1>Verify a League of Legends account on Discord</h1>
      <p class="lead">Link a Riot account to Discord through Riot Sign On. Moon Poro confirms the region and assigns roles matching the current Solo/Duo rank. The password is entered only on Riot's website.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href={siteConfig.discordInviteUrl}>Open the Discord server <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/en/rso/">Review the complete flow</a></div>
      <p class="trust-note">Free service · no advertising · Riot tokens are not stored</p>
    </div>
    <div class="orbit" role="img" aria-label="Flow between Discord, Riot Sign On, verified account and roles">
      <div class="orbit-core"><img src="/moon-poro.png" alt="" width="128" height="128" /></div><div class="orbit-node node-discord">Discord</div><div class="orbit-node node-riot">Riot Sign On</div><div class="orbit-node node-role">Role + rank</div><div class="orbit-node node-account">PUUID</div><p class="orbit-caption">Discord → Riot Sign On → roles</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Four-step verification</p><h2>How verification works</h2></div><p>The bot sends a private one-time link. Authentication happens only on Riot Games' domain. The callback confirms PUUID and platform, then the bot updates roles.</p></div>
    <ol class="process"><li><h3>Click in Discord</h3><p>A private verification link remains valid for 10 minutes.</p></li><li><h3>Sign in with Riot</h3><p>Your password goes only to Riot Sign On, never to Moon Poro.</p></li><li><h3>Riot confirms the account</h3><p>We receive the PUUID, Riot ID and League platform needed for the link.</p></li><li><h3>The bot assigns roles</h3><p>Discord receives verified, region and current Solo/Duo rank roles.</p></li></ol>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h2>Data stored by Moon Poro</h2></div><p>The access token exists in memory for only the requests needed to identify the account. Passwords, access tokens, ID tokens and refresh tokens are never stored.</p></div>
    <div class="data-strip"><div><h3>We retain</h3><ul><li>Discord user and guild IDs</li><li>Riot PUUID and platform</li><li>verification method and time</li><li>limited, audited administrator lookups</li></ul></div><div><h3>We do not retain</h3><ul><li>Riot passwords</li><li>RSO tokens</li><li>Riot account email addresses</li><li>advertising or browsing profiles</li></ul></div></div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/en/privacy/">Read the privacy policy</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
